# 音量ミキサーのマイク (design 11.6, 6.5.6), for tools/ui_run.py: with no microphone the
# part says so and its volume cannot be worked; SVCPROG.ELF records for 12 seconds from
# the test's input (a kernel built with UITEST=1 has one that makes a tone, which takes
# its volume in software); the mixer shows 録音中 and the level, the volume is turned up
# (the kernel says how it took it), muted (the level falls to nothing) and let go, and
# the recording's end is shown. The window is at 200,100, its panel from 206,128: the
# microphone's volume at y 402, 50 at x 469 and 81 at 550, its 消音 at 686,433. Ctrl+E closes.
open 01a0d8c4-5440-7a51-8c62-7e8f90a15440
expect sndmix: ready
expect sndmix: microphone none
win 音量ミキサー
click 600 300
wait 500
shot mic_none
logmark
run /boot/SVCPROG.ELF 49 12000 1
expectsince sndmix: microphone there kind 0 volume 50 mute 0 how 2
expectsince sndmix: microphone recording 1
expectsince sndmix: microphone level 8
shot mic_rec
# turned up, toward the right end: multiplied in software
logmark
click 550 402
expectsince on test: the samples multiplied by 2.
expectsince sndmix: microphone level 9
shot mic_up
# muted: nothing comes, the meter falls
logmark
click 686 433
expectsince mute 1 (0)
expectsince muted on test: the samples multiplied by 0.00
expectsince sndmix: microphone level 0 (
shot mic_mute
# let go, and back to as it comes
logmark
click 686 433
click 469 402
expectsince on test: the samples multiplied by 1.00
# the recording over
expectsincein 30 sndmix: microphone recording 0
expectsince sndmix: microphone none
shot mic_end
key 08 01
wait 500
absent !OACV!
